0..81 Comment "// The folds over a list of naturals — its length, appending and mapping — in"
82..158 Comment "// each spelling an arm admits: a `return` after a `run`, the same with both"
159..235 Comment "// elided, the calls nested in the constructor, and a `run` written inside a"
236..313 Comment "// constructor\'s field. Each spelling of one fold runs to the same value, and"
314..392 Comment "// the polymorphic length of `recursive-lists.gandr` checks at the naturals. A"
393..470 Comment "// structural recursive call stands one stage below the list it was read from"
471..541 Comment "// (Abel, _Termination checking with types_, doi:10.1051/ita:2004015)."
543..602 Comment "// The naturals, the numerals two and three, and the lists."
